    }
}
```

OK so the protocol is:
1. Server sends: [2-byte big-endian length][N-byte payload]
2. Client peeks at the 2-byte length, byteswaps it to get the payload size
3. Client peeks at the payload
4. Client consumes the 2-byte length
5. Client consumes the payload
6. Client validates and processes the payload

